# Markdown / GFM tokens. Random bytes almost never produce a table pipe row
# or a fenced block, so the parser's interesting branches stay unreached
# without these.
"# "
"## "
"###### "
"---"
"***"
"> "
"- [ ] "
"- [x] "
"1. "
"```"
"~~~"
"~~"
"**"
"__"
"`"
"|"
"|---|"
":---:"
"[](" 
"![]("
"<!-- -->"
"&amp;"
"&#x27;"
"\\"
"\x0a\x0a"
